<title>ITALY: Gross yield 7.46 pct at Italy 3-yr Btp auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 7.46 pct at Italy 3-yr Btp auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a first tranche of 2.5 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) carrying a 7.50 pct coupon, and a first tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of five-year Btps with a 7.75 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		   Oct 1, 1999		 Sept 15, 2001</p>
<p> Net Yield	6.50 pct		    6.71 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield    7.46 pct		    7.71 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price 100.45			100.70</p>
<p> Bids	     4.86 trln lire	   6.217 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.50 trln lire	   2.50  trln lire</p>
<p>Note - There were no direct comparisons as the previous auction on September 17 was of an 11th tranche of 8.25 pct three and five-year Btps.</p>
</text>
